  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaamori bakobugwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoni‐Sedeki, omorwoti o Yerusalemu, akaigwa ng’a Yoshua obuire omochie o Ai na oyosiririe kegima, oitire na omorwoti bw’aroro, buna akorete Yeriko na omorwoti bw’aroro. Naboigo akaigwa buna Abagibeoni bakorire omorembe na kobwatana n’Abaisraeli, naende ng’a banyorire ribaga komenya ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono omorwoti oria amo nabaanto baye bakaondoka mono; ekiagera Gibeoni nigo orenge omochie omonene buna omochie onde bwonsi obwate omorwoti; nomonene orenge kobua Ai, na abarwani baye bonsi b’esegi nigo barenge ne chinguru chi’okorwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoni‐Sedeki, omurwoti o Yerusalemu, agatoma abanto gochia ase Hohamu, omorwoti o Heburoni, na Piramu, omorwoti o Yarimuti, na Yafia, omorwoti o Lakisi, na Debiri, omorwoti bw’Egiloni, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiira gocha aa, monkonye, torwanie Abagibeoni, ekiagera barabwo bakorire omorembe na kobwatana na Yoshua na Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abarwoti abwo batano b’Abaamori: oyo o Yerusalemu, na oyo o Heburoni, na oyo o Yarimuti, na oyo o Lakisi, na oyo bw’Egiloni, bagasangererekana amo, bagatiira amo nabarwani babo bonsi, bagaetanana Gibeoni na koyoumokera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abagibeoni bagatoma abanto ase Yoshua agwo Giligali ase atoorete komoteebia, “Tototiga intwe abasomba bao! Ayerera, otiire gocha aa, otokonye na gototooria, ekiagera abarwoti bonsi b’Abaamori, abwo bamenyete ase ense y’ebitunwa, basangererekanire gotorwania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Yoshua na abarwani baye bonsi amo ne chituoni chi’esegi bagatiira korwa Giligali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Yoshua, “Tobairoka, nabekire abanto aba ase okoboko kwao, onde tari oranyare gokobua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotuko obogima Yoshua agataara korwa Giligali, akaumokera Abaamori mobosokano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akabatantania na kobaondokia ase amasio ’Abaisraeli, nabarabwo bakabaita ogoita okonene agwo Gibeoni, akababwatia gochia egetirimboko kia Beti‐Horoni, naende akababwatia na kobaita goika omochie bw’Aseka na oyo o Makeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaamori barenge gotama Abaisraeli, na kobaikire egetirimboko gekorua Beti‐Horoni, Nyasae akabaiyereria amagena ’embura amanene mono korwa igoro ase enchera yabo goika omochie bw’Aseka, nabarabwo bagakwa. Abwo baitetwe namagena ’embura nigo barenge abange kobua abwo baitetwe n’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riri’Omonene abegeete Abaamori ase amaboko ’Abaisraeli, Yoshua agakwana n’Omonene. Ekero Abaisraeli bategererete, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aye erioba, tenena, okire‐kiri igoro ya Gibeoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "naye omotienyi boigo, igoro ye Rikura ri’Ayaloni!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio erioba rigatenena rigakira‐kiri, na omotienyi boigo, goika abanto bakeruseria egesiomba ase ababisa babo. Aya nigo ariikire ase “Egetabu ki’oyore omooronge.” Erioba rigatenena rigakira‐kiri aaria igoro gati‐gati kegima, ang’e rituko rigima, na tiriaayerera kogwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituko rinde tiriana koba buna erio nonya ng’ake, ritang’ani ri’ayio, gose magega y’ayio, ekero Omonene aigwerete Mwanyabaanto. Nyasae nigo arwanererete Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi bakairana Giligali ase batoorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwoti baria batano bagatama, bakebisa ase rikuruma ria Makeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yoshua atebetigwe ng’a abarwoti baria barorekanire bebisete agwo ase rikuruma riria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agachiika, agateeba, “Turunkania amagena amanene, mosieke egesoero kie rikuruma, naende mobeeke abanto barende aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe abande, timobaisa kobeera aroro, mobwatie ababisa baino, mobaumokere korwa magega, na kobaita. Timobatiga basoe emechie yabo, ekiagera Omonene, Nyasae oino, obabekire ase amaboko aino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua na Abaisraeli bakabaita ogoita okonene, goika bakabasiria bonsi otatiga abanto bake boka, abwo batamerete emechie yagiteire chindwaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi bakairana buya ase Yoshua agwo Makeda erio batoorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Onde tarenge noboremu gokwana mamincha y’Abaisraeli naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yoshua agateeba, “Igora egesoero kie rikuruma na mondetere abarwoti baria batano korwa aroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya agakoreka. Bakarusia abarwoti baria batano korwa ase rikuruma: omorwoti o Yerusalemu, na oyo o Heburoni, na oyo o Yerimuti, na oyo o Lakisi, na oyo bw’Egiloni, bakabarenta ase Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abarwoti baria barentetwe ase Yoshua, ere akarangeria Abaisraeli bonsi amo, agateebia abatang’ani b’abarwani, abwo bagendete amo nere ase esegi, “Inchuo aiga ang’e, motache abarwoti aba ebigoti biabo.” Erio barabwo bagaika ang’e, bakabatacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yoshua agateebia abatang’ani baria b’abarwani, “Timoiroka, timokwa emioyo; mobe noboremu na gotenena bokong’u, ekiagera naboigo Omonene arakore ababisa bonsi morarwanie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoshua agaita abarwoti baria, akabatonga ase emete etano; agwo bagasung’unana goika mogoroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero erioba rikogwa Yoshua agachiika ng’a ebitondo bi’abaanto baria bisungorwe, bitugutwe ase rikuruma riria bebisete, na abanto bagakora bo. Naende bakabeeka amagena amanene ase egesoero kie rikuruma, nao are goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria Yoshua akaumokera na kobwata omochie o Makeda, agaita na gosiria nemioro abanto bonsi pi abarenge imeo, amo nomorwoti obo. Onde tatooregete nonya noyomo. Agakora omorwoti o Makeda buna akorete omorwoti o Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoshua amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi bakarua Makeda, bakagenda korwania Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akabeeka omochie oyio amo nomorwoti oye ase amakobo ’Abaisraeli. Bagaita nemioro abanto bonsi pi b’omochie oyio; onde tatooregete nonya noyomo. Naende agakora omorwoti bw’aroro buna akorete omorwoti o Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yoshua akaimoka amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi korwa Libuna, bakagenda Lakisi, bakayoetanana na koyoumokera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omonene akabeeka Lakisi ase amaboko ’Abaisraeli, erio bakayobwata rituko ria kabere, bagaita nemioro abanto bonsi b’omochie, buna bakorete agwo Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Horamu, omorwoti o Geseri, agatiira gokonya Lakisi, korende Yoshua akamoita ere amo nabarwani baye; onde tatigarete ore moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi bakarua Lakisi, bakagenda Egiloni, bakayoetanana na koyoumokera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erio erio bakayobwata, bagaita nemioro abanto b’aroro, buna bakorete omochie o Lakisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa Egiloni Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi bagatiira, bagaika Heburoni bayorwanie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakayobwata na bagaita nemioro omorwoti oye na kera omonto bw’omochie oyio amo nabwo b’emechie ende yarenge ang’e Yoshua agasiria omochie oyio kegima, buna akorete omochie bw’Egiloni; tatigete nonya noyomo abe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi bakairana Debiri, akaumokera omochie oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayobwata amo nomorwoti oye na emechie yonsi yarenge ang’e. Bagaita nemioro abanto abarenge imeo, tibatigaretie nonya noyomo abe moyo. Agakora omochie o Debiri na omorwoti bw’aroro buna akorete omochie o Heburoni, na omochie o Libuna, na abarwoti b’emechie eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Yoshua akaira ense eria engima. Akabua na goita abarwoti bonsi b’ense y’ebitunwa, na eye Negebu, na ey’omwenya, na ey’ebitirimboko. Agaita abanto bonsi pi, tatigaretie nonya noyomo, buna achigetwe n’Omonene Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akabua abanto bonsi korwa Kadeshi‐Barinea goika Gasa, na akaira ense yonsi ya Goseni goika Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo Yoshua akabua abarwoti abwo bonsi, ne chinse chiabo, ase engaki eyemo, ekiagera Omonene Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, nigo arwanerete Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi bakairana Giligali ase batoorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
